Now I'll create the enrichment proposal for the first cube. Based on the inventory, GAP-SC-001 (no cubes defined) is the highest priority. I'll propose a cube based on the `orders` model, which is the most analytical-ready base object with pre-aggregated payment amounts and a relationship to customers.

